## Local developer setup / AI config
/opencode.json
/AGENTS.md
/WORKSTATE_NOTES.md
/do_build_d.bat
/try_build.bat

## Stray diagnostic dumps left at repo root
/disasm.txt
/pdb_*.txt
/cmake_output.txt

## AI assistant config (user-specific)
/.claude/
/CLAUDE.md

## IntelliJ, CLion, etc.
/.idea

# IntelliJ-style CMake bits
cmake-build-*/

## Ninja
.ninja_deps
.ninja_log
build.ninja

## Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

## W3DNext in-game screenshots (F9 hotkey) - keep the folder, ignore the shots
/scrshots/*
!/scrshots/.gitkeep

## Local-only artifacts (machine-specific / regenerable)

/previews/
# STRATAGEM training run raw logs (bulky; keep manifest/REPORT/csv/delta)
runs/**/logs/
runs/_*/

# D3D11 backend runtime diagnostic log (artifact)
d3d11_backend.log

# post-clear capsule (session-local, never committed)
.pcp.md
